{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the past with the Ancient Rome #1 Pack for Color A Cube!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This empire-spanning DLC brings 10 iconic relics of Roman history to Color-A-Cube. From mighty architecture to legendary gear, each model is rich in detail and ready to be colored. Whether you're filling in the precision of a ballista or the grandeur of the Amphitheatre, Ancient Rome #1 lets you relive the glory of the empire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Included Models &amp; Voxel Counts:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf96\ufe0f Centurion Helmet \u2013 5,391 voxels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddcd Legionary \u2013 1,418 voxels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfdb Bath House \u2013 6,812 voxels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udff9 Ballista \u2013 1,302 voxels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udea2 Galley \u2013 858 voxels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfdf Amphitheatre \u2013 6,888 voxels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udeb0 Aqueduct \u2013 5,302 voxels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\ude93 Training Dummy \u2013 1,162 voxels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee1 Scutum \u2013 4,577 voxels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc7 Chariot \u2013 2,155 voxels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're drawn to ancient battles or Roman engineering, this pack brings the Roman empire to your fingertips.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3921470?t=1754993316","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3921470?t=1754993316","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921470/4542d29ce226856f861fc248c09e8cae1c23c1a0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754993316","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921470/4542d29ce226856f861fc248c09e8cae1c23c1a0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754993316","categories":[{"descripti